  "notes": "Datasheet: '4 network links / 4 monitor links', 113 x 88 x 30 mm, 260 g, up to three per 1U rack frame (ARF-1U). Each of the four links is an independent duplex LC coupler - sixteen LC adapters in total, which is why this model has sixteen ports and not four. Same rate ladder as the F1RL (1 Gbps on 62.5 um MM, 1-100 Gbps on OM4, 1-400 Gbps on SM), modelled at the 1G/10G SFP+ class for the same reason as the F1RL: the tap presents LC/UPC adapters, but a simulator link runs port to port, so the ports are caged as SFP+ to stay cableable to the switches they sit between."
